\section{Experiments}

We evaluate the CORA method across several multi-agent environments, including matrix games, differential games, the VMAS simulator \cite{bettini2022vmas}, and the Multi-Agent MuJoCo environment \cite{gymnasium_robotics2023github, kuba2021trust}. 

