\section{Cross-Modal Similarity Attribution}
\label{app:cross_saliency_maps}
This section demonstrates attribution using cross-modal similarities $\mathbf{z}^s \cdot \mathbf{z}^t$ in SPARC's aligned latent space as scalar targets. We compute spatial attribution using both relevancy maps \citep{chefer2021generic} and GradCAM \citep{selvaraju2017grad}, while text attribution uses token relevancy scores \citep{chefer2021generic}.  

