    \item \textbf{DINO Local}: Query image's DINO features → Reference database of CLIP features (both from Local SPARC)
    \item \textbf{CLIP Global}: Query image's CLIP features → Reference database of DINO features (both from Global SPARC)
    \item \textbf{CLIP Local}: Query image's CLIP features → Reference database of DINO features (both from Local SPARC)
\end{itemize}

Each row shows the query image (left) followed by top-10 retrieved images.

