\subsection{Single user question response time}

Figure~\ref{fig:gantt_chart} illustrates the timeline of a single user question execution. Upon receiving a question from the user, the backend triggers LLM Inference and VKG generation concurrently. On average, LLM Inference takes 1.28s, and VKG generation takes 2.89s. Once both processes are complete, the backend proceeds with query refinement and execution (QR + QE in the figure), which takes an additional 0.14s. The total time for processing a single user question on average is thus 3.03s.

